<title>JAPAN: Ishihara Chem hopes to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Ishihara Chem hopes to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ishihara Chemical Co Ltd said on Tuesday it would change company regulations so that it would be able to buy back its own shares.</p>
<p>After the revision, the company will be able to repurchase up to 780,000 of its own shares, Ishihara said in a statement.</p>
<p>The plan needs to be approved at the shareholders' meeting to be held in late June, it said.</p>
</text>
